WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.313
Choose the early KTM 450 EXC as a frame reference.

00:00:02.313 --> 00:00:04.595
Scale the side photo using the 200 mm span on the tape.

00:00:04.595 --> 00:00:07.665
Place the QS138 motor and check its position against the frame.

00:00:07.665 --> 00:00:14.619
Trace a trial enclosure above the motor. Verify final clearances on the bike.

00:00:14.619 --> 00:00:18.787
Enter the measured width across the frame and review the cell layout.

